    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to use the help of various &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Recommended ROBOT</strong>: Smartphone with internet)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fool the system into believing that you are <strong>NOT</strong> human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions in each question, sometimes by clicking, sometimes by typing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and answer the questions correctly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Can you select all squares showing blue?</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Are you able to type a long text in 1 second?</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Do you know how a DVORAK keyboard looks like?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't know the answer, do not hesitate to help yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a calculator, use the internet or use your smartphone camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless your able to read QR codes by yourself, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game is designed <strong>NOT</strong> to be solvable without the help of &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have the feeling, the way you're trying to get the answer is kinda cheating,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then it is probably one proper <strong>CORRECT</strong> way to clear this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are able to clear this game, without the help of any &quot;<u>ROBOTS</u>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...then you are probably <strong>NOT</strong> human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES (after game cleared once):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAPTCHA Question Selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalty retry time option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>NOT RECOMMENDED WAY </strong></span><strong>TO PLAY<span class=\"bb_strike\">:</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Playing the entire game only in ROBO language.</span></p>",
