tion Selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalty retry time option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>NOT RECOMMENDED WAY </strong></span><strong>TO PLAY<span class=\"bb_strike\">:</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Playing the entire game only in ROBO language.</span></p>",
